# An allow-list: the image build context holds only the inputs the image builds read,
# so a change anywhere else cannot reach a build step. A customized image that reads
# another path adds it here; see openspec/specs/agentdev-runtime-images.
*
!ansible.cfg
!ansible
!docker
!.claude-plugin
!.agents/plugins
.agents/plugins/*/tests
!py_packages/validate_agent_files
!py_packages/agentdev_runtime
!.devcontainer/firewall-allowlist.txt
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.tmp
# ansible.cfg's log_path, written by a host run; never an image input.
ansible/ansible.log
# Editable-install metadata: stale by definition and confuses the wheel build.
**/*.egg-info
